            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "In order to use the UI macros, you must set the "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "experimental"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " document attribute. Although this attribute is named "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "experimental"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ", the UI macros are considered a stable feature of the AsciiDoc language. The requirement to specify the attribute is merely an optimization for the processor. If the specification committee determines that an attribute is still necessary, the name of the attribute will likely change to better reflect that the macros are integral to the language."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null,
            "type": "important"
          }
        ],
        "context": "preamble",
        "id": null,
        "outline": null,
        "roles": [],
        "title": null
      },
      {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "It can be difficult to communicate to the reader that they need to press a button. They can’t tell if you are saying “OK” or they are supposed to look for a button labeled "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "OK"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "strong",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ". It’s all about getting the semantics right. The "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "btn"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " macro to the rescue!"
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "listing",
            "id": "ex-btn",
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Press the btn:[OK] button when you are finished.\n\nSelect a file in the file navigator and click btn:[Open]."
              }
            ],
            "language": "asciidoc",
            "roles": [],
            "title": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Using the button macro syntax"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "The result of "
              },
              {
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "Example 1"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "xref",
                "target": "#ex-btn"
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " is displayed below."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "blocks": [
              {
                "context": "paragraph",
                "id": null,
